cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and the paper in preferred-citation."
title: "SEAWEED: SEAfloor WavelEt Extraction and Diagnostics"
version: 1.0.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/ogspros/SEAWEED"
abstract: >-
  An automated workflow, with default parameters, for extracting the
  effective wavelet (source signature with source and receiver ghosts) from
  marine seismic data when a recorded source signature is unavailable, with
  physical and statistical diagnostics from the water-layer multiples and a
  statistical estimate of the amplitude spectrum.
keywords:
  - source signature
  - wavelet extraction
  - marine seismic
  - water-bottom multiple
  - archive data reprocessing
